{"id":"fd3340a3340033d7","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-petrick.md","title":"Petrick covering expression","display":"thm-petrick — Petrick covering expression","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-petrick","aliases":["27-thm-petrick"],"display":"thm-petrick — Petrick covering expression","depends_on":["[[27-df-piset]]","[[27-df-truefalse]]","[[27-df-dnf]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§3.3.1 equations (3.5)–(3.6)","source_printed_pages":"143–144","source_pdf_pages":"167–168","verification_status":"source-statement-and-derivation-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-petrick"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-petrick</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-petrick — Petrick covering expression"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.3.1 equations (3.5)–(3.6)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"143–144"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"167–168"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-derivation-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P=(P_1,\\ldots,P_m):[m]\\to\\mathrm{PI}(f)\">\\(\\mathbf P=(P_1,\\ldots,P_m):[m]\\to\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\)</span> 为双射；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_I\">\\(\\chi_I\\)</span> 是下式构造的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 维特征向量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pet}_{f,\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pet}_{f,\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 的输入域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^m\">\\(\\mathbb B^m\\)</span>。所有空指标积取值为 1。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_I\\coloneqq\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in I\\}\\cup\\{(i,0)\\mid i\\in[m]\\setminus I\\}\\quad(I\\subseteq[m]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_I\\coloneqq\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in I\\}\\cup\\{(i,0)\\mid i\\in[m]\\setminus I\\}\\quad(I\\subseteq[m]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pet}_{f,\\mathbf P}(z)\\coloneqq\\prod_{a\\in T(f)}\\left(1-\\prod_{i\\in[m]:P_i(a)=1}(1-z_i)\\right)\\quad(z\\in\\mathbb B^m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Pet}_{f,\\mathbf P}(z)\\coloneqq\\prod_{a\\in T(f)}\\left(1-\\prod_{i\\in[m]:P_i(a)=1}(1-z_i)\\right)\\quad(z\\in\\mathbb B^m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall I\\subseteq[m]\\;\\left((\\mathrm{Pet}_{f,\\mathbf P}(\\chi_I)=1\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in T(f)\\;\\exists i\\in I\\;P_i(a)=1)\\land\n(\\mathrm{Pet}_{f,\\mathbf P}(\\chi_I)=1\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\{P_i\\mid i\\in I\\})=f)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall I\\subseteq[m]\\;\\left((\\mathrm{Pet}_{f,\\mathbf P}(\\chi_I)=1\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in T(f)\\;\\exists i\\in I\\;P_i(a)=1)\\land\n(\\mathrm{Pet}_{f,\\mathbf P}(\\chi_I)=1\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\{P_i\\mid i\\in I\\})=f)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把书中的 Petrick CNF (3.6) 写成布尔位乘积，空族约定给出 m=0、f=0 时的正确结果。用两个明确双条件，避免旧 A↔B↔C 长链被解释为迭代二元等价而改变含义。覆盖所有真点且每个选项是 implicant，恰表示 f。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-truefalse]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_